        "avatar": null,
        "isUploader": false,
        "isVerified": false
      },
      "text": "The days go by as my stomach continues to feel weak. I lay in bed wondering when it will end but my mind grows darker by the hour. Being lost in my own head is strange… never knowing when you can leave, or if there is any hope. School nights feel like torture. I can’t sleep nor can I stay awake. I am stuck between reality and my own imagination. I just want to be happy…",
